 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Auspicious Beast Summon — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>When you get to 11th level, you gain the last and most powerful Auspicious Beast. As an action for 10 Cursed Energy, you unleash the full power of a dragon. When you use this action, you summon Ryu within 30 ft of you. A creature where Ryu is summoned must make a Strength saving throw or take 8d10 piercing damage. Ryu lasts for up to 10 minutes or until you are unconscious and you can command Ryu as a bonus action. Otherwise Ryu takes the dodge action and defends itself. You can summon one Ryu at a time. Once destroyed, you cannot summon Ryu again for 10 minutes.</p>",
